    "preamble": "Gajanan S/O Chandrabhan Sutar vs State Of Maharashtra Thr Pso., Ps ... on 23 February, 2026 2026:Bhc-Nag:3221 1 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay : Nagpur Bench : Nagpur. Criminal Application [Aba] No. 92 Of 2026 Gajanan S/o Chandrabhan Sutar Versus State Of Mah, Thru. P.S.O., P.S., Khandana, Dist. Yavatmal ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Office Notes, Office Memoranda of Coram, Court's appearances, Court's Orders or directions and Registrar's order ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Mr. S. A. Mohta, Advocate for the applicant Mr. N. S. Autkar, A.P.P. for the non-applicant/State. Coram : M. W. Chandwani, J. Date : February 23, 2026.",
    "facts": "The contraband articles have already been seized by the police which shows that most part of the investigation is already over. Considering the allegations against the applicant, no custodial interrogation of the applicant is necessary. The applicant was protected by interim order of this Court dated 06.02.2026 with a condition to attend the concerned police station. The applicant has attended the concerned police station and cooperated in the investigation.",
